## Moderation Rules (Non-Negotiable — Legal Compliance)

**Every post type has a moderation gate. No post goes live without passing its gate.**

| Post Author | Moderation Gate | Gate Keeper | Badge Shown |
|-------------|----------------|-------------|-------------|
| Student | Parent must click "Allow" | Parent account | 🔒 Parent Approved |
| Parent | School admin reviews (school-scoped posts) | School admin | ✓ Admin Reviewed |
| Teacher | AI screening + Tuto HQ human review | Tuto platform | ✓ AI Reviewed |
| School Admin | Tuto HQ review for public posts | Tuto platform | ✓ Verified |

**Every post card MUST display its moderation badge.** This is a legal requirement for operating in Vietnam with minors.

---

## Teacher Shields / Gamification

Teachers earn "Shields" (points) based on their content contribution:

| Action | Shields Earned |
|--------|---------------|
| Post educational content (tagged with subject + grade) | +5 shields |
| Post non-educational content | +1 shield |
| Each share of their post by another user | +2 shields |
| Each comment received on their post | +1 shield |
| Post reaches 100+ views | +3 shields |

Shield totals determine teacher **rank** (Beginner → Bronze → Silver → Gold → Elite). Rank is displayed on their profile and in teacher discovery lists. Rank helps freelance teachers attract new students and apply for school positions.

