## Privacy Rules (Hard Requirements)

| Data Type | Who Can See It |
|-----------|----------------|
| Student grades / scores | NEVER public. Never on feed. Only in private Tuto app view. |
| Student achievements (positive) | Public OK — with parent consent |
| Homework completion streaks | Public OK — with parent consent (shown as "100% homework star" not actual score) |
| Attendance record | Only positive (100% attendance badge) — never absence info |
| Student photos | Requires explicit parent consent before each photo is shared |
| Teacher content | Visible per audience setting (Public / School / Class / Followers) |
| School announcements | Default: School-scoped. Admin can promote to Public for marketing. |

