## Data Flow (Supabase Only — No Firebase)

```
Mobile (src/) ─────────────────────────────────────────┐
                                                        │
Web (apps/social/) ─────────────────────────────────────┼──► Supabase ──► PostgreSQL
                                                        │      │
                                                        │      ├──► Auth (shared)
                                                        │      ├──► Storage (media)
                                                        │      ├──► Realtime (live)
                                                        │      └──► Edge Functions
```

**ALL social data lives in Supabase.** No Airtable for social features. No Firebase.

