## Post Types Reference

All 9 post types must be handled in every PostCard component:

```typescript
type PostType = 
  | 'text'         // Basic text post
  | 'photo'        // Image post (1-4 photos)
  | 'video'        // Standard video (not Shorts)
  | 'poll'         // Interactive poll (Phase 2)
  | 'event'        // School event with RSVP
  | 'assignment'   // Homework/task post
  | 'achievement'  // Auto-generated milestone (MOST IMPORTANT)
  | 'question'     // Parent/student question post
  | 'announcement' // Official school announcement (pinned)
```

Achievement posts use a DIFFERENT visual treatment — gold gradient card, never a plain white card.

