## Success Metrics (Build With These In Mind)

The North Star metric is: **Weekly Active Posters per School**

Track these events in every feature you build:
- `community_post_created` (post_type, audience, author_role)
- `community_post_viewed` (post_type, viewer_role)
- `community_reaction_added` (reaction_type, post_type)
- `community_comment_added` (post_type)
- `community_achievement_generated` (subject, grade_level)
- `community_teacher_shield_earned` (shield_type, shield_count)
- `community_moderation_approved` (post_type, moderator_type)
- `community_moderation_rejected` (post_type, reason)

